# Canonical host is the apex, https://thealkane.com — every page also declares it
# with <link rel="canonical">. Cloudflare Pages only applies hostname-matching
# rules on custom domains; if www ever resolves without redirecting, add an
# equivalent Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard as the belt-and-braces fix.
https://www.thealkane.com/* https://thealkane.com/:splat 301
